    "body": "## Summary\n- add optional `category` slug filtering to public `GET /jobs/nearby`\n- preserve the existing PostGIS nearby path when no category is supplied\n- support exact leaf slugs and parent-category slugs across direct selectable children\n- normalize category slugs consistently with paginated `GET /jobs`\n- keep distance ordering, radius bounds and public-only location data unchanged\n- add focused service tests for filtered and legacy nearby routing\n- document the shared discovery/category contract\n\n## Architecture / privacy\nThe category predicate is evaluated server-side against persisted `job_categories` relationships and combined with the existing PostGIS `ST_DWithin` predicate. Exact coordinates and private location labels are still not returned by public discovery. No Flyway migration is needed because the category FK/catalog and geospatial columns already exist.\n\n## Verification\nDo not merge unless GitHub CI and payments-ledger smoke are green. Existing runtime smoke remains responsible for PostGIS/Flyway/API behavior; focused unit tests cover category normalization and repository routing.",
